{"_id":"6a2d2cea386b6ddad6d827d7","title":"Script Move buttons","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81babc769ee2d739f7f22898101e0929a0dd0ebcff683e7c1c3e78318e7d632b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1781345514300.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/81babc769ee2d739f7f22898101e0929a0dd0ebcff683e7c1c3e78318e7d632b.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1781345514300.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-Script-Move-buttons-236064","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":4453,"executes":30174,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b858689f23759ca553502fbc610ce7340725c631f19ca004f1e1c08522e7f2ee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1781345514300.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1781345514300.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b858689f23759ca553502fbc610ce7340725c631f19ca004f1e1c08522e7f2ee.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1781345514300.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1781345514300.png"},"likeCount":4,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-06-13T10:11:54.328Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-13T10:11:54.328Z","lastBump":"2026-06-13T10:11:54.328Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/panchooo677/Nynyn-/refs/heads/main/README.md\"))()","features":"By claude ai\nWhat Is This?\nThis script lets you customize any in-game UI by moving, resizing, and deleting buttons or elements wherever you want on your screen\n\nEdit Mode This is what you turn on when you want to start moving stuff around. When it says ON you are in editor mode, when it says OFF nothing can be selected or moved\n\nSave Config Once you are happy with where everything is, hit this to save your layout It saves as v1 then v2 then v3 and so on each time you save\n\nLoad Config Opens a list of all your saved layouts so you can pick one to apply. You can also set any save to Auto ON which means it loads automatically every time you run the script without you needing to do anything.\n\nTrash Shows you everything you have deleted. If you deleted something by accident you can get it back from here.\n\n\nHow To Move and Edit Buttons\n\nFirst turn on Edit Mode. Then tap any button or UI element in the game and it will get highlighted with a cyan outline meaning it is selected. From there you just drag it anywhere you want on screen\n\n Size+ Makes the selected element bigger each time you tap it\n\n Size - Makes the selected element smaller each time you tap it\n\nDelete Hides the element completely so it no longer shows on your screen\n\nNote📝This script may not work in some games you can modify it and tell the AI to fix it for you","tags":["Move buttons","Script Universal","Modify game buttons"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"654434fe5596c75b0c292d93","username":"PHOFF","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aad2a61aa699e1d43c16ec39a1ceacf26db6a90dd7046956538f2b9f4ce8362d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/654434fe5596c75b0c292d93-1788977121843.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"654434fe5596c75b0c292d93","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aad2a61aa699e1d43c16ec39a1ceacf26db6a90dd7046956538f2b9f4ce8362d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/654434fe5596c75b0c292d93-1788977121843.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T21:54:36.608Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a2d2cea386b6ddad6d827d9","editBy":{"_id":"654434fe5596c75b0c2